{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98307","id":2133004072,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc5_Iw8o","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98307","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98307.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98307.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98307","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98307/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98307/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98307/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/62516df757401ad5280a1384bd6d341aac8ac1df","number":98307,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Precompute projection matrices when rendering 2D shadows","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Small optimization I found while profiling CPU performance. `light_update_shadow()` was calculating the same matrices every time it was called even though they never change. \r\n\r\nI also pulled the calculation of the projection matrix out of the loop (although I am 99% certain this was optimized out of the loop anyway in release builds).\r\n\r\nProfiled when running the [Isometric demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/2d/isometric)\r\n\r\n_Before: `light_update_shadow()` takes 17.1% of the CPU frame time_\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-10-16 18-09-40](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea3de187-5a7a-4bec-addc-c96576c764ce)\r\n\r\n_After: `light_update_shadow()` takes 14.7% of the CPU frame time. Notice that the `from_euler` chunk is gone completely_\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-10-16 18-09-46](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e434fb56-ffa0-4371-bf1e-1377b8f604d9)\r\n\r\nThis demo is GPU-bound so this doesn't change the framerate. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga",